  "description": "基于AScript扩展的SQL脚本语言；\n快速开始：\n// 添加sql脚本语言\nScript.Langs.Set(\"sql\", SqlLang.Instance);\nstring s = @\"\n@lang sql\nselect name,age from list where name like 'to%' and age=10\n\";\nvar script = new Script();\nscript.Context.SetVar(\"list\", new [] { new Person(\"tommy\", 15), new Person(\"tony\", 10) });\nvar list = script.Eval<IEnumerable<dynamic>>(s).ToList();\nAssert.AreEqual(1, list.Count);\nAssert.AreEqual(\"tony\", list[0].name);\nAssert.AreEqual(10, list[0].age);",
